e6a661ef-8fe1-4803-8ec8-15c18a46a5d2\" />\r\n\r\nAlso somewhat unrelated, but `add_library_dialog` sets the title multiple times for no reason:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4d4f7291edef168a8c2f3b82d7aec2ea5dfad75f/editor/animation/animation_library_editor.cpp#L52-L53\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4d4f7291edef168a8c2f3b82d7aec2ea5dfad75f/editor/animation/animation_library_editor.cpp#L544-L545\r\nThis can be assigned once, when the dialog is created.\r\n\r\nProtip if you want to make similar PRs: after finishing the obvious pass (i.e. checking if editor updates properly after changing language), search all changed files for `TTR(` and see if they shouldn't be replaced.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3923359590/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"resolved"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3928239454","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116451#issuecomment-3928239454","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116451","id":3928239454,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7qJC1e","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/u